.SH DESCRIPTION

The
.B auto-devd-mount-setup
command installs and enables devd-mount and related tools npmount(1)
and qmediamanager(1) on FreeBSD systems.  These three tools work
together to automatically mount removable media and display a menu
when they are attached to the system.  The menu provides options
such as opening the media in a file manager, reformatting, copying an
image to the media, and unmounting.

Note: The same script configures devpub-mount(1) on NetBSD.

.SH RETURN VALUES

0 on success, non-zero error codes otherwise.

